stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> Uncached
    Uncached --> Cached: action touches the<br/>partition (lazy, per block)
    Cached --> Evicted: LRU, under execution<br/>memory pressure
    Cached --> Lost: executor gone
    Evicted --> OnDisk: MEMORY_AND_DISK<br/>spills to disk
    OnDisk --> Cached: read back from disk
    Evicted --> Uncached: MEMORY_ONLY<br/>drop, recompute from lineage
    Lost --> Uncached: recompute from lineage
